---
import TrustRow from './TrustRow.astro';
---

<section class="sec" id="story">
 <div class="wrap story-layout">
 <div class="story-left">
 <div class="story-left__sticky">
 <div class="story-heading reveal">
 <span class="eyebrow"><b>01</b> Our story</span>
 <h2 class="display">The science of you.</h2>
 </div>

 <article class="story-purpose reveal">
 <h3 class="story-col__label">Your skin notes</h3>
 <p>
 One photo in daylight is enough to start. We check the light, the framing and how much
 skin we can see first. If we cannot read it, we ask for another photo instead of guessing.
 </p>
 </article>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="story-right">
 <div class="story-intro reveal">
 <p class="story__statement">We use AI for one job: narrow the shelf, then show why.</p>
 <p class="story__lede">The details stay with each result, so you can revisit them later.</p>
 </div>

 <div class="story-detail reveal">
 <h3 class="story-col__label">Scan, learn, refine</h3>
 <p>
 Your readings settle into a profile you can correct. Corrections shape future
 matches.
 </p>
 <TrustRow />
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>
